# Currency Converter: "Whenever you discard a card" counts a discard an opponent makes you do. Bot2's Wheel of Fortune
# makes both players discard their hands at once: Bot1's four cards are each offered to its Converter and accepted (four
# cards exiled), and Bot2's six are not (the neighbouring scenario shows that, with the Wheel cast by Bot1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Currency Converter
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Wheel of Fortune
Island x5
Mountain
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Currency Converter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot2.Hand.Wheel of Fortune.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Accept
[Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Exile = Lightning Bolt; Forest; Swamp; Swamp
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Hand.Count = 7
Bot2.Graveyard.Count = 8
